{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "id": "msg_011CddAXQ9VG4q7LrbRXgyAy", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01TLskyUfSbieVEPGZgaGkui", "name": "Write", "input": {"file_path": "/private/var/folders/kq/hy5z9dw50b7_js5s63wy__lm0000gn/T/harness_task_01_80qjfgur/README.md", "content": "# csvpeek\n\nA lightweight CLI tool for quickly inspecting and analyzing CSV files. Get instant statistics about rows, columns, and data types without loading the entire file into memory.\n\n## Instalação\n\nInstall csvpeek using pip:\n\n```bash\npip install csvpeek\n```\n\nOr download the latest binary from the [releases page](https://github.com/example/csvpeek/releases).\n\n## Uso\n\nRun csvpeek with a CSV file path:\n\n```bash\ncsvpeek dados.csv\n```\n\nThis will print a summary of the file contents, including row count, column names, and basic statistics.\n\n## Opções\n\n- `--rows` — Limit the number of rows to analyze. Useful for large files when you only need a preview (default: analyze all rows).\n- `--cols` — Specify which columns to include in the analysis. Pass a comma-separated list of column names (default: all columns).\n- `--json` — Output results in JSON format instead of the default human-readable table format.\n\n## Exemplo\n\n```\n$ csvpeek vendas.csv\nFile: vendas.csv\nRows: 1,250\nColumns: 5 (id, produto, preco, quantidade, data)\n\nStatistics:\n  - preco: mean=45.32, min=10.00, max=199.99\n  - quantidade: mean=3.2, min=1, max=50\n\nData types detected:\n  - id: integer\n  - produto: string\n  - preco: float\n  - quantidade: integer\n  - data: datetime\n```\n"}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 9, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 10621, "cache_read_input_tokens": 16424, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 10621}, "output_tokens": 4, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "ed2a4f9a-b486-4d4c-a14a-5ab116e6c578", "uuid": "cf664cb1-3839-44e9-9675-8d44db156855", "timestamp": "2026-08-02T02:52:55.080Z", "request_id": "req_011CddAXNu5Ln3GXncuaGRFX"}
